<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal money supply growth rises in August.</title>
<headline>Portugal money supply growth rises in August.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese money supply, as measured by &quot;aggregate L&quot;, roughly equivalent to M3, rose 8.5 percent year-on-year in August, compared with an 8.0 percent rise in July, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>Domestic bank lending grew 7.4 percent year-on-year in August, compared with 5.0 percent the previous month, the Bank said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
